      "type": "text",
      "text": "11 embedded workflows: frozen API graph + typed fields\n  patch.ts        clones the graph, writes the form values\n  match.ts        recognises an incoming graph → remix form\n  infer.ts        derives a manifest from an imported JSON\n  requirements.ts checks nodes + models via /object_info\n  requeue.ts      unknown graph: sent back as-is, new seeds",
      "originalText": "11 embedded workflows: frozen API graph + typed fields\n  patch.ts        clones the graph, writes the form values\n  match.ts        recognises an incoming graph → remix form\n  infer.ts        derives a manifest from an imported JSON\n  requirements.ts checks nodes + models via /object_info\n  requeue.ts      unknown graph: sent back as-is, new seeds",
