      "type": "text",
      "text": "Python custom node grafted onto PromptServer\n(same port 8188, no outgoing call)\n\nGET  /komfy/files    recursive output+input listing\nPOST /komfy/delete   → .komfy-trash (never an rm)\nPOST /komfy/move  ·  POST /komfy/mkdir\nGET  /komfy/trash ·  POST /komfy/trash/empty",
      "originalText": "Python custom node grafted onto PromptServer\n(same port 8188, no outgoing call)\n\nGET  /komfy/files    recursive output+input listing\nPOST /komfy/delete   → .komfy-trash (never an rm)\nPOST /komfy/move  ·  POST /komfy/mkdir\nGET  /komfy/trash ·  POST /komfy/trash/empty",
