      "type": "text",
      "text": "GET /view downloads the PNG bytes → pngMetadata.ts extracts the `prompt` tEXt\nchunk (the original graph) → match.ts walks it structurally against the 11\nmanifests (node IDs may differ) → prefilled form. No match: requeue.ts sends the\nraw graph back with fresh seeds, or \"Import as workflow\" (infer.ts).",
      "originalText": "GET /view downloads the PNG bytes → pngMetadata.ts extracts the `prompt` tEXt\nchunk (the original graph) → match.ts walks it structurally against the 11\nmanifests (node IDs may differ) → prefilled form. No match: requeue.ts sends the\nraw graph back with fresh seeds, or \"Import as workflow\" (infer.ts).",
      "fontSize": 12,
