      "type": "text",
      "text": "GET /komfy/files lists output/ and input/ recursively; extension missing: falls back\nto GET /history + /internal/files/output. Deleting = moving to .komfy-trash; the\nonly permanent removal is \"Empty trash\", explicit and confirmed.",
      "originalText": "GET /komfy/files lists output/ and input/ recursively; extension missing: falls back\nto GET /history + /internal/files/output. Deleting = moving to .komfy-trash; the\nonly permanent removal is \"Empty trash\", explicit and confirmed.",
