      "type": "text",
      "text": "GET /health (unauthenticated) tells \"machine unreachable\" apart from \"ComfyUI\ndown\" → POST /start or /stop with the token → the supervisor launches\nscripts/comfy.js and streams logs/comfyui.log over WS into the console screen.",
      "originalText": "GET /health (unauthenticated) tells \"machine unreachable\" apart from \"ComfyUI\ndown\" → POST /start or /stop with the token → the supervisor launches\nscripts/comfy.js and streams logs/comfyui.log over WS into the console screen.",
