      "type": "text",
      "text": "npm run pair prints a QR komfy://setup?u=…&s=…&t=… carrying the ComfyUI URL,\nthe supervisor URL and the token. Scanned in-app or opened as a deep link, it\nconfigures everything at once; the token is generated locally, never committed.",
      "originalText": "npm run pair prints a QR komfy://setup?u=…&s=…&t=… carrying the ComfyUI URL,\nthe supervisor URL and the token. Scanned in-app or opened as a deep link, it\nconfigures everything at once; the token is generated locally, never committed.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
