      "type": "text",
      "text": "the ComfyUI API has no authentication: the perimeter IS the tailnet, and there is\nno fallback path — no LAN mode, no port forwarding, no relay. The supervisor adds\na Bearer token for process control and logs, and only ever runs a fixed script.",
      "originalText": "the ComfyUI API has no authentication: the perimeter IS the tailnet, and there is\nno fallback path — no LAN mode, no port forwarding, no relay. The supervisor adds\na Bearer token for process control and logs, and only ever runs a fixed script.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
